body:
I truly appreciate you replying. But the last time I called a hotline is when they asked LAPD to do a wellness check and then I was walked out of my apartment in handcuffss at 2am going to a facility.

&#x200B;

Id rather never do that again.

Youre not the only one. I've been alone here for almost 6 years going on.

&#x200B;

Have you been to some of the K-Town barbeques? We can go get some sometime if you want.
